// The join half of canon_body, split out so that canon_body has an action to
// spend on dropping `blank` nodes first.
//
// The split is here rather than at the five call sites because `id` forbids a
// call inside a call's argument: canon_body(blank_drop(x)) is illegal, so
// filtering outside would cost every caller a named intermediate, and four of
// the five callers are already at the action limit.

canon_join(int[] stmts) {
  string out = "";
  int i = 0;
  while(i < len(stmts)) {
    out = out + sep_at(";", i) + canon_stmt(stmts[i]);
    i = i + 1;
  }
} return string out;
